Commit:     Fabricio Breve <fbreve@gmail.com>
CommitDate: Mon Oct 26 13:31:53 2026 -0300

    Preserve OPLL state across savestates
    
    Add v17 savestate support for the complete future-relevant OPLL state using a sequential 32-bit snapshot/restore interface backed by one M10K.
    
    Freeze FM progression during savestate operations and restore the OPLL state before audio execution resumes, preserving phase, envelope, feedback and other temporal state that cannot be reconstructed from the existing savestate image.
    
    Keep deterministic fallback behavior for older savestate versions.

